OL,3,AMillions cast early ballots in Alberta
OL,4,Areferendum as separation vote under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in the province of Alberta are
OL,7,Fvoting today on whether they want to
OL,8,Fremain a part of Canada or move ahead
OL,9,Fwith a referendum on independence -
OL,10,Fhere's what their ballots look like
OL,12,FMore than a million people cast early
OL,13,Fballots, Election Alberta - the agency
OL,14,Foverseeing the vote - says,
OL,15,Frepresenting over 43% of eligible
OL,16,Fvoters
OL,18,F"I don't even consider myself to be
OL,19,FCanadian anymore," one voter tells the
OL,20,FBBC, while another says she's "nervous"
OL,21,Fthat an independent Alberta "would just
OL,22,Fbe a pawn for the US"
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
