OL,3,AMillions cast early ballots in Alberta
OL,4,Areferendum as separation vote under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeparatists argue the province - which
OL,7,Fhas the fourth largest oil reserves in
OL,8,Fthe world - has been overlooked by
OL,9,FOttawa
OL,11,FMeanwhile, indigenous Albertans have
OL,12,Fbeen working to block the vote for
OL,13,Fmonths, arguing separation would
OL,14,Fviolate their land treaties
OL,16,FHow are Canada's allies viewing this
OL,17,Flong-shot provincial vote? - our chief
OL,18,Finternational correspondent weighs in
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
